    "Corrected values are used throughout FLwatch, including glucose alerts, Apple Watch, widgets, Live Activities, and Apple Health export." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the calibration affects the user's data.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
